  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Financing Facility for Women, Children and Adolescents MultiDonor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The objective of the GFF Trust Fund is to enhance country and
 global efforts to improve the health and nutrition outcomes of women, adolescents and children, and (ii) achieve the health and nutrition related Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) by 2030 to accelerate universal health coverage.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
